00_add_Pvalues.sh

Converts Z scores to p-values. Necessary for munged sumstats that lack a P column before they can be used for MAGMA.

01_magma_annotate.sh

Creates a file annotating SNPs to genes.

02_magma_gene_analysis.sh

Produces gene scores from summary statistics and the snploc file.

03_magma_merge.sh

Merges all chromosomes from the previous.

04_magma_geneset.sh

Produces gene set enrichments from merged gene scores.

add_P.R

This is the script used by 00_add_Pvalues.sh

unweighted_heatmap.R

Takes the output from 04 and calculates enrichment correlations, then produces heatmap PDFs for each gene set collection.